[[31,63,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before removing and refitting\nthe Air Bag module and Curtain, the following preliminary operations\nmust be carried out.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Place the ignition key in the OFF position and extract it;</p><p>Disconnect the battery leads and insulate.</p><p>Wait for 10 minutes before continuing.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>FOLLOW ALL THE RECOMMENDED SAFETY\nFULES (<a href=\"#/3025608\">5580C</a> ).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Driver&#x27;s Head Bag</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024695\">Q40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Passenger Head Bag</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024699\">Q41</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts fixing the rear pipe.</p><p>3. Mov the rear seat belt reel.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005086.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Undo  the front link retaining volt</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005087.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the curtain retaining nuts</p><p>2. Remove the Air Bag module and Curtain.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005088.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts if necessary</p><p>2. Remove the front bracket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005089.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Observe the following precaution.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Handle the curtain air bag module\nwith extreme care. Ensure the battery is disconnected. If a new module\nis being fitted, attach the appropriate labels.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Detach the removable part of the adhesive\nlabel from the new module and put it in a specific file recording the\nvehicle details (model, registration data, chassis no.) and the\nserial no. of the old module. This file should be kept for future\nchecks.</p><p>A new label is supplied together with the\nmodule to be stuck on top of the existing one. It must be perforated first\nby the month, 10 years after the year in which the module is fitted\n(e.g. for 2000, this will be 2010).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005090.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. If removed, position the front bracket and secure it using the\nbolts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT BRACKET</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.8</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005091.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Position the head bag module</p><p>2. Tighten the bolts fixing the curtain.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>HEAD BAG CURTAIN</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.8</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005092.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Tighten the front link retaining bolt</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>HEAD BAG FRONT ROD</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.8</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005093.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Tighten the bolt fixing the rear seat belt reel.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR SEAT BELT REEL MOUNTING BRACKET/.....</p></td><td><p>7/16&quot;</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Tighten the bolts fixing the rear pipe.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>HEAD BAG UNIT</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.8</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Connect the electrical connection.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005094.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]